<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>&#160;</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Securities
Authorized for Issuance under Equity Compensation Plans</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 30.6pt; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">As
of the date of this Annual Report, the Company has authorized 2,500,000 shares of Common Stock for issuance under our 2023 Stock Incentive
Plan (the &#8220;2023 Plan&#8221;). We do not grant options under our 2017 Employee Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2017 Plan&#8221;)</span>
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">as it was superseded by the 2023 Plan.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following table summarizes information of outstanding options as of December 31, 2022:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

