  <td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F11_zXjnsMpecBxg" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote000810" xml:lang="en-US">During 2020, Gix Media engaged with a subcontractor for the
development of an internal-use software (the &#8220;Software&#8221;). Gix Media capitalized its developments costs until March 1, 2022 and
from this date the Software became available for use. Accordingly, Gix Media recognized amortization expenses over the estimated useful
life of the Software determined to be three years. For the period from March 1, 2022, until December 31, 2022, Gix Media recorded amortization
expenses of $<span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__us-gaap--SoftwareDevelopmentMember_zEdoDXb5zNxf" title="Amortization expenses" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEdPT0RXSUxMIEFORCBJTlRBTkdJQkxFIEFTU0VUUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="VBIX:IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">122</ix:nonFraction></span>.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
</table>


