taxes are comprised of the following components:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;<span id="xdx_8B6_zu9iT0pD2Vec" style="display: none; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">SCHEDULE
OF DEFERRED INCOME TAXES</span></b></span></p>

