</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-01to2022-12-31" escape="true" name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80C_eus-gaap--SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock_zXEssuBxlQ4i" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTE
17: <span id="xdx_82A_zTOEZu2LYI2e">SEGMENT REPORTING</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Group operates in two different segments, since the Cortex Transaction in 2021 (see note 7.A), in such a way that each company in the Group
operates as a separate business segment.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Search
segment</b>- the search segment develops a variety of technological software solutions, which perform automation, optimization and monetization
of internet campaigns, for the purposes of obtaining and routing internet user traffic to its customers.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Digital
content segment</b>- the digital content segment is engaged in the creation and editing of content, in different languages, for different
target audiences, for the purposes of generating revenues from leading advertising platforms, including Google, Facebook, Yahoo and Apple,
by utilizing such content to obtain internet user traffic for its customers.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
segments&#8217; results include items that directly serve and/or are used by the segment&#8217;s business activity and are directly allocated
to the segment. As such they do not include depreciation and amortization expenses for intangible assets created at the time of the purchase
of those companies, financing expenses created for loans taken for the purpose of purchasing those companies, and therefore these items
are not allocated to the various segments.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Segments&#8217;
assets and liabilities are not reviewed by the CODM and therefore were not reflected in the segment reporting.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>A.
Segments revenues and operating results:</b></span></p>

