    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">This
    amount includes a one-time bonus cash payment of NIS 50,000 granted as a reward to Mr. Hadad for his performance in connection with
    the Reorganization Transaction with Gix Media.</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
